AL2023 reports ID_LIKE=fedora but carries a much smaller package set, so the
Fedora line above does not transfer. Renamed: manpages-dev/manpages-posix-dev ->
man-pages, exuberant-ctags -> ctags, device-tree-compiler -> dtc, python-pip ->
python3-pip, p7zip-full -> p7zip + p7zip-plugins, gvim -> vim-enhanced (there is
no X11 vim build).

Not packaged at all, install.sh pulls these from upstream release tarballs into
~/bin: ripgrep, bat, fzf. Also unavailable: the_silver_searcher, minicom,
uboot-tools, astyle, git-secret, tcputils, xsel/xclip, neovim. pwclient comes
from PyPI now, patchwork stopped serving the script.

